1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:01,826
Shiv Mahimna Stotra says,

2
00:00:01,826 --> 00:00:03,755
Shiva has eight bodies... Come,

3
00:00:03,755 --> 00:00:05,560
let's have his darshan today.

4
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:13,410
First, Earth.

5
00:00:16,150 --> 00:00:16,570
Second,

6
00:00:20,850 --> 00:00:22,420
Water. Third,

7
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:27,000
Fire. Fourth,

8
00:00:29,630 --> 00:00:31,060
Air. Fifth,

9
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:35,080
Infinite sky.

10
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:41,360
Sixth, Sun.

11
00:00:42,730 --> 00:00:43,930
Seventh, Moon.

12
00:00:46,920 --> 00:00:48,720
And eighth, Soul,

13
00:00:51,610 --> 00:00:54,090
which at this moment... is inside you.

14
00:00:58,440 --> 00:00:59,888
[Sanskrit] You are earth, you are moon,

15
00:00:59,888 --> 00:01:00,890
you are wind, you are fire,

16
00:01:01,510 --> 00:01:02,796
[Sanskrit] you are water, you are sky,

17
00:01:02,796 --> 00:01:04,150
you are the earth, and you are the soul.

